      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TARA I AM (5) showed good pace and went on to score by a neck when resuming last time out over 1100m at Rockhampton. Well placed and there is no reason why she cannot salute. EMILIA JANE (1) pushed forward from a wide draw last time out and was prominent for a long way before fading to finish ninth over 1400m at Townsville. Well placed and expected to feature. ADRANOS (2) has switched yards since finishing ninth two weeks ago over 1350m at Ipswich. This is easier and rates among the leading chances. SHIPPING LANE (4) returns from a spell of nine months and is having his first run for a new yard. Finished fourth at Doomben over 1200m when first-up last time in work. Will be fit enough for this following a recent trial win and can run a race while fresh.",
